SipHash reference C implementation and official vectors
Authors: Jean-Philippe Aumasson and Daniel J. Bernstein
Source: https://github.com/veorq/SipHash
Upstream revision: 32d067603b93b47828700880649198e0bfbbcffa
Retrieved: 2026-09-08
License: CC0 (see LICENSE_CC0 and the source copyright headers)

siphash_ref.h is upstream siphash.c with the filename changed and one
trailing space removed from a comment; executable code is unchanged.
siphash.h is unmodified. vectors64.h packs upstream vectors_sip64 byte arrays
into equivalent little-endian uint64_t constants.
These files are independent test oracles, not part of the contest template.
